                 ("How much does it cost to use the grass range?",
                  "Baskets start from £4 for a small basket, with larger baskets better value for longer sessions. There is no separate charge for using the turf rather than a covered bay. Prices are reviewed occasionally, so confirm on 07710 582036 if you are planning a long session."),
